// Global variables: written, read back, and reached from more than one place
// in the program. Their addresses are the translator's business, so the
// results are put on the stack where a comparison can name them.
push 111
pop first
push 333
pop second
push 888
pop third

push first
push second
add  // 444
push third
push first
sub  // 777

// A global written twice keeps the second value.
push 5
pop first
push first  // 5
